WEBVTT

00:01:35.410 --> 00:01:38.080
The size adjustments have been made.

00:01:38.480 --> 00:01:39.910
Thank you very much.

00:01:40.520 --> 00:01:42.920
We should make sure we're prepared for the Sutofes.

00:01:42.920 --> 00:01:44.570
I'll try it on right now.

00:01:44.570 --> 00:01:45.230
Okay.

00:02:23.690 --> 00:02:25.030
Both of them?

00:02:25.030 --> 00:02:26.620
Was everything canceled?

00:02:26.620 --> 00:02:29.200
Yes, I don't have anything planned for the afternoon.

00:02:33.130 --> 00:02:35.680
Yeah, that was a surprise.

00:02:35.680 --> 00:02:37.040
When I woke up...

00:02:40.130 --> 00:02:41.900
Oh, hello.

00:02:41.900 --> 00:02:43.050
Hey.

00:02:43.050 --> 00:02:44.200
Hello.

00:02:44.200 --> 00:02:45.130
Going to class?

00:02:45.130 --> 00:02:47.250
Yeah. I was thinking about stopping by the club.

00:02:48.540 --> 00:02:53.610
We're going to Akiba and Nippori. Do you want to come with us?

00:02:54.520 --> 00:02:59.700
Oh, no. I need to take care of a few things.

00:02:59.700 --> 00:03:00.490
I see.

00:03:01.210 --> 00:03:02.070
See you later.

00:03:03.320 --> 00:03:04.850
Have a nice trip.

00:03:12.770 --> 00:03:14.960
Well, that's what it felt like.

00:03:14.960 --> 00:03:17.200
It was an awkward, "why are you inviting me?" moment.

00:03:17.200 --> 00:03:20.050
Yeah, that's a pretty awkward situation.

00:03:20.050 --> 00:03:21.800
It wouldn't be considerate to Ohno-san.

00:03:22.340 --> 00:03:23.540
Yeah.

00:03:23.540 --> 00:03:25.410
There's no way I could go with them.

00:03:25.410 --> 00:03:28.950
Yeah. Well, how should I put this, you know...

00:03:28.950 --> 00:03:30.100
What is it?

00:03:30.440 --> 00:03:32.760
Don't you want to kill Tanaka at times?

00:03:34.020 --> 00:03:35.450
I don't think those kinds
of feelings are normal.

00:03:35.910 --> 00:03:37.490
Of course they are!

00:03:37.490 --> 00:03:40.120
We're talking about Ohno-san, after all.

00:03:40.900 --> 00:03:44.030
Madarame-san, are you saying you're attracted to Ohno-san?

00:03:44.030 --> 00:03:46.740
No, no. I'm talking from a general perspective.

00:03:46.740 --> 00:03:53.900
I spite him, but I'm just as envious.
He probably does this and that to her, and...

00:03:53.900 --> 00:03:56.590
Oh, you're right.

00:03:56.590 --> 00:03:59.300
You could say it's kind of like that.

00:03:59.300 --> 00:04:00.340
Like what?

00:04:00.640 --> 00:04:03.860
Don't you get an occasional urge to play
an ero-game featuring a well-endowed girl?

00:04:03.860 --> 00:04:04.600
Hey, hey.

00:04:05.040 --> 00:04:06.480
Doesn't something come to mind?

00:04:06.480 --> 00:04:08.590
Isn't that your area of expertise, Sasahara?

00:04:08.590 --> 00:04:11.350
Come on. Give me a break.

00:04:11.350 --> 00:04:14.150
I wouldn't know much about it.

00:04:14.150 --> 00:04:18.530
Well, the new character from
Pretty Menma 2 has nice breasts.

00:04:18.530 --> 00:04:20.940
I think her name is Cutie Tonko or something stupid.

00:04:21.230 --> 00:04:25.140
Tonko... Oh, as in tonkotsu.
I bought that but never got around to it.

00:04:25.140 --> 00:04:28.260
Not every girl from that game has large breasts, though.

00:04:28.260 --> 00:04:33.710
Oh, the new character also has
long, black hair, just like Ohno-san.

00:04:33.710 --> 00:04:36.880
That's low! You're more vulgar than I am.

00:04:37.590 --> 00:04:39.010
Really?

00:04:39.010 --> 00:04:43.390
Well, Ohno-san doesn't cosplay
as ero-game characters anyway.

00:04:45.100 --> 00:04:48.070
No, that isn't the issue.

00:04:49.150 --> 00:04:51.730
Well, in any case, you know...

00:04:51.730 --> 00:04:53.180
Do you have something else to say?

00:04:53.540 --> 00:04:56.440
Even otakus can have girlfriends, can't they?

00:04:57.120 --> 00:04:58.510
You're right.

00:04:59.320 --> 00:05:02.770
We do have Kousaka-kun, though.

00:05:03.120 --> 00:05:05.110
Oh, that's right,

00:05:05.110 --> 00:05:07.310
but he's in a league of his own.

00:05:07.310 --> 00:05:09.270
I don't think they're going out.

00:05:10.210 --> 00:05:10.950
Kousaka?

00:05:11.300 --> 00:05:14.370
No, Tanaka-san and Ohno-senpai.

00:05:19.270 --> 00:05:21.100
Oh, yeah.

00:05:21.100 --> 00:05:22.340
They're at a standstill at the moment.

00:05:22.340 --> 00:05:23.980
Is that right?

00:05:23.980 --> 00:05:27.630
I was treating them based on the
assumption that they were going out.

00:05:27.630 --> 00:05:28.720
Me, too.

00:05:28.720 --> 00:05:31.880
Girls are more knowledgeable about these things.

00:05:31.880 --> 00:05:33.970
Isn't that how you guys act, though?

00:05:33.970 --> 00:05:36.890
All of you raise a white flag from
the start just to protect your pride.

00:05:38.030 --> 00:05:41.150
Those two got along well right from the beginning, though.

00:05:41.150 --> 00:05:43.530
Well, I won't deny that.

00:05:43.530 --> 00:05:45.820
That's why they seem to be so tentative.

00:05:45.820 --> 00:05:49.020
A long spring does not necessarily precede good things.

00:05:49.020 --> 00:05:49.660
Yeah.

00:05:50.590 --> 00:05:52.440
Is that how it is?

00:05:52.440 --> 00:05:54.330
Can I say something?

00:05:55.060 --> 00:05:55.810
What is it?

00:05:55.810 --> 00:05:59.420
I have absolutely no interest in this topic.

00:05:59.420 --> 00:06:01.050
Well, in your case, it isn't
hard to understand why.

00:06:01.050 --> 00:06:03.060
It's not, right?

00:06:03.630 --> 00:06:06.460
Who cares whether strangers are dating each other?

00:06:06.790 --> 00:06:06.910
That's why I was reluctant to bring up the subject.

00:06:10.130 --> 00:06:11.910
They're at a difficult point in their relationship.

00:06:11.910 --> 00:06:12.420
According to my story, I'm the protagonist! No matter how many times you change the scenario, it still revolves around me!

00:06:12.420 --> 00:06:14.140
Is that so?

00:06:14.140 --> 00:06:17.730
There's no room for women in a man's world!
I have a feeling it'd be best to leave things at Ohno and Tanaka's pace.

00:06:17.730 --> 00:06:20.030
The only thing I'm interested in is myself!

00:06:20.030 --> 00:06:24.480
Complete all of the heroine's
routes and aim for a harem ending!

00:06:24.480 --> 00:06:26.770
Obtain all of the 2D CG pictures, too!

00:06:26.770 --> 00:06:29.110
I thought you two were going to Akiba.

00:06:29.110 --> 00:06:32.910
Well, there was a change of plans.

00:06:37.330 --> 00:06:39.430
One moment, you two.

00:06:39.430 --> 00:06:40.050
What?

00:06:40.050 --> 00:06:40.540
Yes?

00:06:41.140 --> 00:06:42.300
Are you two going out?

00:06:45.520 --> 00:06:50.220
I asked whether you guys were going out.

00:06:50.220 --> 00:06:52.280
Come on, you two!

00:06:56.610 --> 00:06:56.650
With that hobby both of you seem to share,
are you two doing it while yelling "bachikoi" every night...

00:06:56.980 --> 00:06:58.690
You... Die!

00:07:01.840 --> 00:07:03.880
H-How exciting! I can't move at all!

00:07:03.880 --> 00:07:05.660
Well, well. Don't pay any attention to him.

00:07:05.660 --> 00:07:08.910
Don't stop! Use more force!

00:07:08.910 --> 00:07:11.950
Well, we're not really going out.

00:07:13.930 --> 00:07:14.810
Right?

00:07:14.810 --> 00:07:16.290
Yeah.

00:07:16.290 --> 00:07:17.830
Oh, as I thought.

00:07:17.830 --> 00:07:19.370
Really?

00:07:20.040 --> 00:07:23.710
That can't be true!
Are you saying you haven't done it while in costume?

00:07:32.110 --> 00:07:34.430
I'd never do anything to bring disgrace upon the character.

00:07:37.540 --> 00:07:39.580
I-I'm sorry, Kuchiki-kun!

00:07:39.580 --> 00:07:40.950
Did it hurt?

00:07:42.350 --> 00:07:45.360
There's no reply. It looks like his body's become a corpse.

00:07:45.750 --> 00:07:51.000
Oh, I'm really sorry. I think
I should go home now.

00:07:51.000 --> 00:07:53.330
There must be something wrong with me.

00:07:59.070 --> 00:08:00.790
Don't you think there's a problem here?

00:08:01.070 --> 00:08:04.130
I wonder what's wrong.

00:08:07.530 --> 00:08:11.380
Now that you've accepted the garlic topping,

00:08:11.380 --> 00:08:16.010
you'll definitely transform into the smelly Menma!

00:08:21.780 --> 00:08:22.670
Morning!

00:08:23.630 --> 00:08:24.850
Good morning.

00:08:25.310 --> 00:08:28.070
Sorry about yesterday.

00:08:28.980 --> 00:08:32.010
Oh, that? It wasn't a big deal.

00:08:32.010 --> 00:08:33.980
Kucchii got what he deserved.

00:08:34.380 --> 00:08:36.700
I don't know what to do.

00:08:37.120 --> 00:08:39.830
I haven't spoken to Tanaka-san since that day.

00:08:39.830 --> 00:08:43.380
Well, what I'm about to say might sound insensitive,

00:08:43.380 --> 00:08:46.880
but from an outsider's perspective,
anyone would think you two were going out.

00:08:48.120 --> 00:08:50.050
Is that so?

00:08:50.630 --> 00:08:51.710
How do you feel about him, Ohno?

00:08:54.380 --> 00:08:56.860
It doesn't even need to be said, huh?

00:08:56.860 --> 00:08:59.740
I'm sure Tanaka feels the same way.

00:08:59.740 --> 00:09:01.560
Do you think so?

00:09:01.560 --> 00:09:02.850
What makes you think otherwise?

00:09:03.830 --> 00:09:06.520
It feels like he tries to avoid me at the most crucial moment.

00:09:06.520 --> 00:09:09.440
I wonder why. Is there a reason?

00:09:14.140 --> 00:09:17.170
Well, I mean... he's probably just as scared as you are.

00:09:17.170 --> 00:09:21.100
You two seem to be the inexperienced type.

00:09:21.700 --> 00:09:23.670
I'm not experienced.

00:09:23.670 --> 00:09:24.970
That goes without saying.

00:09:24.970 --> 00:09:27.300
It's unusual to hear someone say that about me.

00:09:27.300 --> 00:09:31.000
I've always been perceived as the experienced type.

00:09:32.070 --> 00:09:33.260
Is it because of your body?

00:09:33.690 --> 00:09:34.750
Yes.

00:09:36.780 --> 00:09:39.560
Well, we've known each other for a while,

00:09:39.560 --> 00:09:41.360
so it wasn't hard to figure out.

00:09:42.940 --> 00:09:45.140
What should I do?

00:09:45.140 --> 00:09:47.200
I don't even know where to start.

00:09:47.200 --> 00:09:49.920
Wow, are you serious?

00:09:50.550 --> 00:09:55.340
Well, if you take the initiative,
any guy would turn into putty in your hands, Ohno.

00:09:55.340 --> 00:09:58.680
No way! I can't do it...

00:09:58.680 --> 00:10:00.360
If I could, I would have done it already.

00:10:02.710 --> 00:10:05.850
Cosplay seduction is out of the question, right?

00:10:05.850 --> 00:10:09.330
Well, I do have to maintain the character's personality.

00:10:09.330 --> 00:10:12.320
Why don't you try cosplaying as an ero-game character?

00:10:12.320 --> 00:10:15.060
I've never played an ero-game before.

00:10:15.400 --> 00:10:16.480
Really?

00:10:16.480 --> 00:10:17.310
I'm telling you the truth.

00:10:17.900 --> 00:10:20.530
I've even seen Kousaka play them.

00:10:20.530 --> 00:10:23.170
I think that's a little weird of Kousaka-san.

00:10:28.400 --> 00:10:33.190
Ogiue-san, I'm surprised you were able to tell Tanaka-san wasn't going out with her.

00:10:34.060 --> 00:10:35.600
It was only a guess.

00:10:36.640 --> 00:10:39.450
Those two were made for each other.

00:10:39.450 --> 00:10:41.680
They should ask each other out already.

00:10:42.220 --> 00:10:43.830
It'd be better if they didn't.

00:10:45.340 --> 00:10:48.290
Nothing good comes from an otaku dating another otaku.

00:10:52.960 --> 00:10:57.050
We will be arriving at Odaiba Kaihin Kouen soon.

00:10:57.050 --> 00:10:58.920
Are you going to go out tonight?

00:10:59.220 --> 00:11:02.630
Well, yeah. It'd be great if we could go to the usual place.

00:11:04.600 --> 00:11:05.560
All right!

00:11:12.230 --> 00:11:15.700
Excuse me, excuse me.
Could you look this way?

00:11:26.830 --> 00:11:28.400
Sorry for the wait.

00:11:28.910 --> 00:11:33.250
Hey, we've been talking about where we should go.

00:11:34.860 --> 00:11:36.210
With everyone?

00:11:38.970 --> 00:11:42.340
Sorry, I just remembered I had something to do.

00:11:43.460 --> 00:11:44.590
Um...

00:11:58.690 --> 00:12:01.320
Ohno-san hasn't stopped by in the past few days.

00:12:02.450 --> 00:12:05.530
Neither has Tanaka.

00:12:05.530 --> 00:12:08.040
Their situation isn't going to remain like this, is it?

00:12:08.040 --> 00:12:13.080
Well, you never know. Circle-related incidents involving women aren't out of the ordinary.

00:12:13.510 --> 00:12:16.450
I don't think that's what happened.

00:12:21.220 --> 00:12:23.640
What am I supposed to do from now on?

00:12:24.090 --> 00:12:26.110
Y-You're going to make up with her, right?

00:12:26.110 --> 00:12:28.050
A-Ask her out.

00:12:28.050 --> 00:12:30.380
That's easier said than done.

00:12:30.380 --> 00:12:35.120
How long do you think I've been enduring this? We're talking about Ohno-san, you know!

00:12:35.120 --> 00:12:36.990
I-I don't understand what you're talking about.

00:12:38.870 --> 00:12:41.150
She's too good for me.

00:12:42.730 --> 00:12:44.400
Both of you are otakus, aren't you?

00:12:44.400 --> 00:12:48.710
Well, it's more than obvious if you look at me,

00:12:48.710 --> 00:12:50.320
but Ohno-san's different, isn't she?

00:12:52.250 --> 00:12:55.900
No, O-Ohno-san's the same,
no matter how you look at it.

00:12:55.900 --> 00:13:01.300
Yeah. Her hairstyle might give her
away, but she's always been pretty.

00:13:01.670 --> 00:13:04.430
N-No, you're giving her too much credit.

00:13:06.300 --> 00:13:10.460
In comparison to Kasukabe-san, who could pass for a celebrity,

00:13:10.460 --> 00:13:14.040
O-Ohno-san's just cuter than a lot of ordinary girls.

00:13:14.460 --> 00:13:15.560
Is that so?

00:13:17.130 --> 00:13:19.550
Y-You might be right,

00:13:19.860 --> 00:13:22.150
but you don't hold back at all.

00:13:22.150 --> 00:13:25.480
I-Isn't that what you wanted to hear?

00:13:39.830 --> 00:13:44.320
<i>Listen, y-you're starting to imagine things.</i>

00:13:44.320 --> 00:13:46.410
<i>There's no reason to be depressed.</i>

00:13:46.410 --> 00:13:50.510
<i>You're not enduring anything. You're just a coward.</i>

00:13:51.870 --> 00:13:53.510
<i>That's pretty brutal.</i>

00:13:53.510 --> 00:14:00.100
<i>O-Of course it is! Look at me.
I'll be a v-v-v-virgin for the rest of my life.</i>

00:14:04.760 --> 00:14:06.160
That didn't take long.

00:14:06.160 --> 00:14:08.910
Yeah, I was nearby when I called you.

00:14:09.140 --> 00:14:10.320
Um...

00:14:12.130 --> 00:14:14.830
Tanaka-san, have you been playing ero-games?

00:14:16.960 --> 00:14:19.250
Well, yeah, you could say that.

00:14:20.010 --> 00:14:24.270
Could you show me the packages of the latest games?

00:14:34.190 --> 00:14:36.560
I want to cosplay as this character!

00:14:38.690 --> 00:14:39.890
It's an ero-game character.

00:14:39.890 --> 00:14:43.160
People aren't very selective these days,

00:14:43.160 --> 00:14:45.080
especially for uniform-related characters, right?

00:14:45.080 --> 00:14:49.220
This one even has an attractive
transforming magical girl outfit to choose from.

00:14:49.220 --> 00:14:50.940
Still...

00:14:51.350 --> 00:14:54.260
Tanaka-san, have you finished this character's route?

00:14:54.260 --> 00:14:56.620
I m-might have played through it once.

00:14:56.900 --> 00:15:02.110
W-Well, I-I thought she looked a little like you, Ohno-san,

00:15:02.110 --> 00:15:04.250
b-but the personalities are completely different.

00:15:04.560 --> 00:15:08.240
Of course they are! That's why I want to know more about her.

00:15:08.240 --> 00:15:10.810
Play through her scenario one more time right now.

00:15:10.810 --> 00:15:12.570
I'll watch beside you.

00:15:13.470 --> 00:15:17.430
It's okay, I'll just lend it to you.
It's not a difficult game to play.

00:15:17.430 --> 00:15:20.000
No, you have to do it now!

00:15:20.000 --> 00:15:21.880
Come on! Come on! Come on!

00:15:21.880 --> 00:15:23.690
It'll take too much time!

00:15:23.690 --> 00:15:26.440
It'll take at least ten hours to complete the route.

00:15:27.110 --> 00:15:29.110
Play through the night.

00:15:44.250 --> 00:15:50.170
W-Well, I don't know about playing all
night, but let's just start from the beginning.

00:15:51.360 --> 00:15:52.330
Please.

00:16:02.060 --> 00:16:07.600
The Goro ramen franchise doesn't
use condiments like menma and leeks.

00:16:07.600 --> 00:16:11.150
Those are mere decorations!
Management doesn't understand anything!

00:16:11.980 --> 00:16:14.490
It's more or less like this.

00:16:14.490 --> 00:16:15.680
Do you want to continue?

00:16:15.680 --> 00:16:18.060
We just started playing.

00:16:21.120 --> 00:16:25.560
It's warm... This is the first time I've felt so relaxed.

00:16:25.560 --> 00:16:28.130
U-Um, that about sums it up.

00:16:28.130 --> 00:16:29.940
It hasn't even been that long.

00:16:48.310 --> 00:16:50.060
I get the message, Ohno-san.

00:16:50.060 --> 00:16:52.730
I-I get it, so give me a second.

00:16:53.060 --> 00:16:54.350
What is it?

00:16:54.350 --> 00:16:55.490
We were just getting to the good part.

00:16:56.000 --> 00:16:58.860
Uh, well... Sorry, but I can't
take any more of this.

00:17:02.010 --> 00:17:04.320
You win. You win.

00:17:04.320 --> 00:17:05.730
What am I going to do?

00:17:05.730 --> 00:17:07.010
About what?

00:17:10.680 --> 00:17:14.100
Um... Do I really have to say it?

00:17:21.480 --> 00:17:22.820
I...

00:17:24.180 --> 00:17:26.510
I like you, Ohno-san,

00:17:27.850 --> 00:17:32.480
but I don't have any confidence.

00:17:32.480 --> 00:17:34.290
Confidence in what?

00:17:35.770 --> 00:17:41.280
How should I say this... I don't match up to your looks, and I don't know if I can make you happy, Ohno-san.

00:17:41.830 --> 00:17:44.370
In other words, when it comes down to it,

00:17:44.370 --> 00:17:46.730
helping you cosplay is all I can do for you, Ohno-san.

00:17:47.130 --> 00:17:49.760
If you take that away, there's nothing else I can offer you

00:17:50.200 --> 00:17:52.800
since I don't have any other traits.

00:17:52.800 --> 00:17:57.890
I'm just an ugly otaku, so I don't have any confidence when it comes to going out with someone like you.

00:17:58.190 --> 00:18:03.890
What are you saying? You're the one who
gave me confidence in the first place, Tanaka-san.

00:18:04.590 --> 00:18:07.750
I didn't know anyone when I came back to Japan.

00:18:07.750 --> 00:18:12.690
I felt helpless, but you made a perfect outfit for me, Tanaka-san.

00:18:13.100 --> 00:18:16.980
You gave me the ability to show off my cosplay
hobby in front of other people without any doubts.

00:18:17.950 --> 00:18:21.680
It's not only the cosplay outfits, Tanaka-san.

00:18:21.680 --> 00:18:23.910
You're nice and reliable,

00:18:24.720 --> 00:18:27.800
although you can be a little too kind to others.

00:18:28.110 --> 00:18:30.290
You make costumes for too many people.

00:18:31.830 --> 00:18:34.270
Let's make a deal.

00:18:34.270 --> 00:18:38.310
You're not allowed to make costumes
for anyone else without my permission.

00:18:38.310 --> 00:18:40.340
I'll go out with you if you can do that.

00:18:41.730 --> 00:18:43.900
It sounds as if you're calling the shots.

00:18:46.660 --> 00:18:48.060
What do you say?

00:18:50.950 --> 00:18:53.350
Still can't muster up any confidence?

00:18:53.860 --> 00:18:55.400
No, it's just...

00:18:58.050 --> 00:19:00.070
I'll provide all the confidence you need.

00:19:26.300 --> 00:19:29.900
U-Um... You're pretty good at this, aren't you?

00:19:30.510 --> 00:19:31.720
Good at what?

00:19:31.720 --> 00:19:32.520
Kissing.

00:19:34.320 --> 00:19:35.930
Um, that was my first kiss.

00:19:38.360 --> 00:19:40.530
It was my first kiss, too.

00:19:43.220 --> 00:19:44.770
I knew that.

00:19:45.130 --> 00:19:51.970
Well, it might be because I've played through a lot of ero-games while simulating the situation in my mind.

00:19:51.970 --> 00:19:53.430
You were still able to do it, right?

00:19:53.430 --> 00:19:54.610
Somehow.

00:19:57.090 --> 00:19:59.590
How was it? Have you gained some confidence?

00:19:59.980 --> 00:20:01.760
Y-Yeah, somewhat.

00:20:03.610 --> 00:20:06.010
Making out in a cosplay outfit...

00:20:07.320 --> 00:20:11.350
If that's something you're interested in,
I'll do it whenever you want, Tanaka-san.

00:22:08.060 --> 00:22:09.340
How is it?

00:22:13.760 --> 00:22:16.770
Well, it looks good.
I don't know anything about that character, though.

00:22:17.920 --> 00:22:20.890
That's Cutie Tonko.

00:22:21.880 --> 00:22:23.510
Right.

00:22:31.120 --> 00:22:33.180
Cutie Tonko!

00:22:40.830 --> 00:22:46.380
Well, I wanted to cosplay to apologize for yesterday...

00:22:47.740 --> 00:22:51.090
That's an ero-game character, isn't it?

00:22:55.090 --> 00:22:56.180
What the...

00:23:04.820 --> 00:23:06.980
W-What the hell just happened?

00:23:10.980 --> 00:23:12.540
So you have an otaku girlfriend, huh?

00:23:12.540 --> 00:23:13.790
Wh-What of it?

00:23:13.790 --> 00:23:15.380
Don't you feel a little uneasy?

00:23:15.380 --> 00:23:19.320
She understands everything you've been talking about as far as your hobbies and interests go.

00:23:19.320 --> 00:23:20.580
Well, that's...

00:23:20.580 --> 00:23:24.120
She might end up buying ero-games and doujinshis, asking whether you like those kinds of things.

00:23:24.120 --> 00:23:25.920
It'd be from the bottom of her heart, too.

00:23:25.920 --> 00:23:27.800
If I were in your shoes, I'd die.

00:23:27.800 --> 00:23:29.840
Well, it's not that bad.

00:23:29.840 --> 00:23:31.540
What's not bad?

00:23:31.540 --> 00:23:34.690
If I take her hobbies into consideration,
it's like I've gained twice as many things to enjoy.

00:23:34.690 --> 00:23:38.210
Is this what you'd call a complete victory?!
